sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Parent
  participant AUTH as Supabase Auth, OAuth 2.1 server
  participant AI as Parent's AI app
  participant API as Jadwigo API, /api/mcp
  AI->>API: POST, no token
  API-->>AI: 401, where to sign in
  AI->>API: GET the metadata
  API-->>AI: the auth server
  AI->>AUTH: authorization request
  AUTH->>P: sign in, then consent
  P-->>AUTH: yes
  AUTH-->>AI: token, 1 hour at most
  AI->>API: tools/call + token
  API->>API: 1 unit per call
  API-->>AI: this family's data
